Feature: Canonical umbrella classification accepts issue scope manifests
  Canonical umbrella classification previously rejected the lifecycle-required issue-scope.json sidecar.
  The classifier now recognizes the exact regular blob while preserving complete tree identity and strict safety boundaries.

  @SCN173001 @regression
  Scenario: Accept a scope manifest in every classifier mode
